@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "待核实" as Pending
state "到账已确认" as Confirmed
state "未到账已核实" as Failed
[*] --> Pending : 提出到账核查\n[有患者与交易线索]\n/ 不计可用余额
[*] --> Confirmed : 确认到账\n[登记时已取得到账证据]\n/ 形成可分配来源
Pending --> Confirmed : 确认到账\n[已核实金额与渠道]\n/ 形成可分配来源
Pending --> Failed : 确认未到账\n[有明确失败依据]\n/ 保留核查结论
Confirmed : 分配已收款 [有未分配余额且账目同患者]\n/ 保留分配
Confirmed : 确认预付用途 [可用余额足够]\n/ 保留抵扣

@enduml
